# Premium tax credit, part 2 (difftest scaffold)

> Using Types
> Using Ptc_allowed as A

This scope exists for `make difftest SCOPE=ptc_allowed`
(`difftest/mappings/ptc_allowed.mjs`, issue #33). It runs
`Ptc_allowed.PtcAllowed` on the same inputs and exposes each month of Form 8962
lines 12 to 23 as scalar outputs (`<month>_<column>`), because the runner
compares scalar outputs only. Every input is passed through unchanged; keep
the input list in step with `PtcAllowed`.

```catala
## Row `m` (1 to 12) of Form 8962 lines 12 to 23.
declaration ptc_month content A.PtcMonth
  depends on
    rows content list of A.PtcMonth,
    m content integer
  equals
    match (List.nth_element of rows, m) with pattern
    -- Present content r: r
    -- Absent: impossible

declaration scope PtcAllowedDifftest:
  input filing_status content Types.FilingStatus
  input is_mfj_dependent condition
  input not_mfj_and_primary_filer_could_be_dependent_and_claimer_is_required_to_file_or_filing_for_credits condition
  input primary_filer_is_claimed_as_dependent condition
  input is_married condition
  input secondary_filer_residency_eligible_for_mfj condition
  input lived_apart_last_six_months condition
  input all_eligible_filers_are_us_citizens_or_nationals condition
  input claimed_dependents_count content integer
  input has_qsehra condition
  input household_income_as_percent content decimal
  input ptc_annual_contribution_amount content money
  input ptc_monthly_contribution_amount content money
  input form1095_as content list of A.Form1095A
  input writable_has_ptc_qualifying_plan condition
  input writable_has_advanced_ptc condition
  input dependent_tp_self_enrolled condition
  input dependent_tp_enrolled_someone_else condition
  input writable_dependent_tp_other_members_are_part_of_different_tax_family condition
  input writable_has_mfs_exception condition
  input writable_claiming_mfs_exception_for_fourth_straight_year condition
  input writable_below100_threshold_and_not_eligible_for_medicaid_because_of_immigration_status condition
  input writable_has_employer_sponsored_plan condition
  input writable_dependents_required_to_file condition
  input writable_self_reported_has_multiple1095_as condition
  input writable_is_additional_person_in_enrollment_family condition
  input writable_is_additional_person_partof_different_tax_family condition
  input writable_is_enrolled_with_other_family condition
  input writable_has_immigration_status_not_eligible_for_marketplace condition
  input writable_wants_to_use_alt_calculations condition
  a scope A.PtcAllowed
  output maybe_eligible_for_ptc condition
  output has_ptc_qualifying_plan condition
  output has_advanced_ptc condition
  output not_ptc_applicable_tax_payer condition
  output potentially_applicable_tax_payer condition
  output may_need_to_file_form8962 condition
  output needs_to_file_form8962 condition
  output needs_to_file_form8962_monthly condition
  output ptc_can_report_annual_totals condition
  output total_ptc_annual_premium content money
  output total_annual_slcsp_premium content money
  output total_annual_aptc_amount content money
  output annual_max_premium_assistance content money
  output annual_ptc_allowed content money
  output total_ptc_amount_allowed content money
  output total_aptc_amount_taken content money
  output ko_dependent_tp_requires_allocations condition
  output ko_has_ptc_qualifying_plan_and_qsehra condition
  output ko_needs_allocations condition
  output ko_has_employer_sponsored_plan condition
  output ko_dependents_required_to_file condition
  output ko_self_reported_has_multiple1095_as condition
  output ko_has_immigration_status_not_eligible_for_marketplace condition
  output ko_wants_to_use_alt_calculations condition
  output ko_tp_needs_to_add1095_a condition
  output ko_tp_needs_to_delete1095_a condition
  output unsupported condition
  output jan_has_active_policy content boolean
  output jan_enrollment_premium content money
  output jan_slcsp_premium content money
  output jan_contribution_amount content money
  output jan_max_premium_assistance content money
  output jan_ptc_allowed content money
  output jan_advance_payment content money
  output feb_has_active_policy content boolean
  output feb_enrollment_premium content money
